'''Gingerbread''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. It has a brown blade and handle, with two white lines of icing surrounded by colored sprinkles. The guard is white and the handle has a while outline around the inside.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Gingerbread Gun (2022)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

